Subject: [PATCH 02/11] xnu 0197-0200 stacked: audio amp probe, haptic,
 charger, display-dark power

The four feature branches (claude/audio-0197, haptic-0198, charge-0199,
sleep-0200) each apply on 0196 alone; these are the same changes rebased to
apply in sequence (0199/0200 differ only in diff context).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

